  "name": null,
  "problem": "The following table shows the rate $r(t)$, in flour bags per minute, at which a machine makes flour over a period of $75$ minutes.\n\n| $t\\,\\text{(minutes)}$ | $0$ | $15$ | $30$ | $45$ | $60$ | $75$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $r\\,\\text{(flour bags/minute)}$ | $30$ | $25$ | $35$ | $40$ | $35$ | $25$ |\n\nUse the right Riemann sum for $r(t)$ over the interval $[0,75]$, with five subintervals, to approximate the number of flour bags made by the machine in $75$ minutes.",
